                    {
                        "sense_id": "5cdfe61c-d727-31d3-8eda-e20c797279f9",
                        "entry_id": "03ef1eaa-6eee-395c-abb4-b226e508dc93",
                        "glosses": [
                            "源自朝鮮語的姓氏。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0be6fd7d-f1ee-3457-9944-6bc0333a76d7",
                        "entry_id": "03ef1eaa-6eee-395c-abb4-b226e508dc93",
                        "glosses": [
                            "洋縣（中國陝西漢中的縣）。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53b63f7e-312c-4ee2-bfdf-36995bd89045",
                                "sense_id": "0be6fd7d-f1ee-3457-9944-6bc0333a76d7",
                                "text": "Liang and Yang were the names of two commanderies to the southwest of Ch'ang-an; Yang is the modern Yang county, Shensi, and Liang, the administrative center of Shan-nan West circuit, also known as Hsing-yuan, on the borders of Shensi and Szechuan.",
                                "translation": "梁州和洋州是長安西南面的兩個州：洋州即現代的陝西洋縣，而山南西道的治所梁州，亦稱興元府，則在陝西和四川的交界處。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02610653-9493-4159-a1cc-83010c2a3e9b",
                                "sense_id": "0be6fd7d-f1ee-3457-9944-6bc0333a76d7",
                                "text": "The well-known Hanzhong Basin, extending from Yangxian to Mianxian, about 80 kilometres from east to west and 10 to 15 kilometres from north to south, is a major farming area.",
                                "translation": "著名的漢中盆地，從洋縣延伸至勉縣，東西長80公里，南北寬10-15公里，是主要的農業區。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "147bb222-b499-4255-aea0-55d57eee5b41",
                                "sense_id": "0be6fd7d-f1ee-3457-9944-6bc0333a76d7",
